format-version: 1.2
default-namespace: PomGeneExRNA
ontology: pomgeneex
remark: The controlled RNA-level qualifier terms offered by PHI-Canto's wt_rna_expression
remark: annotation type (namespace PomGeneExRNA in canto_base.yaml). Not hosted by OLS4, so
remark: IDs resolve offline against this file — the same pattern as fypo_extension.obo.
remark: PROVENANCE: the seven IDs were supplied by the curator (Martin Urban) on 2026-07-24
remark: and are NOT independently verified against a PomBase release — no public PomGeneEx
remark: artifact was located. The phrases themselves were already confirmed from a PHI-Canto
remark: UI screenshot on 2026-07-11 (see docs/BACKLOG.md). Re-confirm the ID/phrase pairing
remark: against Canto before treating this file as authoritative.
remark: SCOPE: RNA-level qualifiers only. The parallel protein-level vocabulary
remark: (PomGeneExProt, used by wt_protein_expression) is NOT included — its IDs were not
remark: supplied, so a protein-level annotation must still carry the phrase alone.

[Term]
id: PomGeneEx:0000011
name: RNA level increased
def: "RNA present at a higher level under one condition or timepoint than otherwise." [PHI-Canto:curators]

[Term]
id: PomGeneEx:0000012
name: RNA level decreased
def: "RNA present at a lower level under one condition or timepoint than otherwise." [PHI-Canto:curators]

[Term]
id: PomGeneEx:0000013
name: RNA level unchanged
def: "RNA present at the same level under one condition or timepoint as otherwise." [PHI-Canto:curators]

[Term]
id: PomGeneEx:0000014
name: RNA present
def: "RNA detected, with no level comparison made." [PHI-Canto:curators]

[Term]
id: PomGeneEx:0000015
name: RNA absent
def: "RNA not detected." [PHI-Canto:curators]

[Term]
id: PomGeneEx:0000016
name: RNA level constant
def: "RNA level stays steady across conditions or timepoints." [PHI-Canto:curators]

[Term]
id: PomGeneEx:0000017
name: RNA level fluctuates
def: "RNA level varies across conditions or timepoints." [PHI-Canto:curators]
